      "start_seconds": 1.32,
      "end_seconds": 2.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 3.49,
      "end_seconds": 7.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Yes, have a a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.49,
      "end_seconds": 18.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.39,
      "text": "um so... swollen ankles. That's why I came. I'm not great at remembering details so bear with me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.99,
      "end_seconds": 22.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.89,
      "end_seconds": 28.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "I've had it for nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.49,
      "end_seconds": 33.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "Understood. Rate it it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.41,
      "end_seconds": 37.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "pretty moderate if I'm being honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.34,
      "end_seconds": 44.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "and what about cough with blood palpitations calf pain or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.54,
      "end_seconds": 47.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "no, I'd have said so"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.15,
      "end_seconds": 51.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.74,
      "end_seconds": 53.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.48,
      "end_seconds": 70.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "right, do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.41,
      "end_seconds": 75.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.79,
      "end_seconds": 80.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.67,
      "end_seconds": 85.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.86,
      "end_seconds": 88.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "And your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.21,
      "end_seconds": 93.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.3,
      "end_seconds": 102.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "before we go further, any allergies? I'll explain everything as we go along"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.98,
      "end_seconds": 106.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Yes, kiwi. I get hives."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.22,
      "end_seconds": 123.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "alright, what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.43,
      "end_seconds": 127.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Heart failure, for two years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.78,
      "end_seconds": 138.83,
      "duration_seconds": 10.05,
      "text": "Right so heart failure is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Okay tell me your medicines please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.72,
      "end_seconds": 144.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Spironolactone, 25 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.6,
      "end_seconds": 160.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "time for your numbers if that's okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.65,
      "end_seconds": 169.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.91,
      "end_seconds": 186.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 134 over 87 heart rate 116."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.02,
      "end_seconds": 194.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.4,
      "end_seconds": 202.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.91,
      "end_seconds": 207.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "So, shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.02,
      "end_seconds": 210.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.03,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.88,
      "end_seconds": 212.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.59,
      "end_seconds": 233.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "I can hear crackles at the bases of both lungs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.07,
      "end_seconds": 252.28,
      "duration_seconds": 13.21,
      "text": "you can sit up now. Let me tell you where I've got to. I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at fluid overload from heart failure or a chest infection"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 253.32,
      "end_seconds": 256.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.05,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.24,
      "end_seconds": 279.89,
      "duration_seconds": 21.65,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's fluid overload from heart failure and we'll know more once the blood tests is back. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had swollen ankles for nearly five years moderate and no calf pain or cough with blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.78,
      "end_seconds": 282.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "yes that's right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.99,
      "end_seconds": 326.9,
      "duration_seconds": 33.91,
      "text": "Let's book blood tests to look into fluid overload. Weigh yourself every morning and tell us if you gain more than two kilos in three days. The community nursing team would be the right next step, I'll refer you. One warning sign to remember: you become more breathless or gain weight quickly. In that case don't wait. We'll catch up after the heart scan. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 328.84,
      "end_seconds": 332.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "right I'll do that. Thank you doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.58,
      "end_seconds": 335.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "look after yourself"
    }
  ]
